# Keep line endings identical for both teammates.
#
# WHY this matters for us: we work in shifts on Windows and hand the repo
# over by pushing and pulling. Without this, one person's editor can rewrite
# every line ending in a file, and the next `git diff` shows the WHOLE file
# as changed -- which hides the three lines that actually changed and makes
# handovers confusing (PRD.md section 10).
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores everything with LF in the repo while letting
# Windows check it out however it likes.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be line-ending converted or they break.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
